Z||000000||87ECO5||11-19-2000||09:44 PM||||Well, except for a few minor details, the calendar is ready for print this upcoming weekend.  That means it'll be ready for sale starting Monday, November 27th.<P>Here is a preview of one month:<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Junecal_1.jpg"> <P>Please keep in mind that this is a rough scan.  The actual calendar looks <B>MUCH</B> nicer!<P>If you'd like to start sending your payments, you may do so now.  First Class shipping is going to run about $1.50 per calendar.  And of course, I can ship multiple calendars (up to two pounds worth) via Priority Mail for $3.20.  Contact me directly for destinations outside the continental U.S.<P>Please make checks payable to Scott Haas (contact me directly –  <A HREF="mailto:Fiero87EC5@aol.com">Fiero87EC5@aol.com</A>  for PayPal information).  Here is my address:<P>320 West Market Street<BR>Springboro, Ohio 45066<P>When sending your payment, please be sure to include the address to which you wish to have the calendar(s) sent.  Also, keep in mind they are large so the mail person may fold them to get them into small boxes!<P>Any questions, please contact me directly via email.<P>Once again, thank you for your business.||||reg||14
